      "subsystem": "trainee-prep",
      "target_id": "0x088A",
      "text": "此单位不能出击。[.][X]\n"
    },
    {
      "english_payload_sha256": "32074ec614c6f27bff423c876c13ba11a9cee9843ca5527e938005a2ae61d172",
      "key": "game.trainee_prep.msg_88b",
      "source_text_sha256": "ab0927a70df4ac0539ecd6b5d6ed728c30c128abc67c2a0a8e8ec32b961e3e93",
      "subsystem": "trainee-prep",
      "target_id": "0x088B",
      "text": "没有可用武器时，[.][LF]\n无法发动攻击。[.][X]\n"
    },
    {
      "english_payload_sha256": "fe1089e0ab1d7444265356c3a0613d11daaee19db2cb6e8846d4a7831bdc9ec6",
      "key": "game.chapter_event.msg_944",
      "source_text_sha256": "9a275ce69714c8fe9c16c78eb08fcde3343e70ded8a9e1420c35fa86f41c8a70",
      "subsystem": "chapter-event",
      "target_id": "0x0944",
      "text": "我方单位加入了战斗。[A][LF]\n所有蓝色的我方单位都能[LF]\n像艾瑞珂一样进行操作。[.][A][X]\n"
    },
    {
      "english_payload_sha256": "ccb94a408c70cd5ef67400be2316ae5ef79428ec03e3da189b884631f7984e62",
      "key": "game.chapter_event.msg_945",
      "source_text_sha256": "4ac5f79cd449724f833c21d1444fb1fa17c9f5684e0a86805ca15b2c78b1e09b",
      "subsystem": "chapter-event",
      "target_id": "0x0945",
      "text": "击败了驻守缪兰城的古拉德军[.][LF]\n敌将普利肯。[.][A][LF]\n现在只需 [.][ToggleRed]占领[.][ToggleRed] 城门 [.][LF]\n即可获胜。[A][LF]\n只有部队的 [ToggleRed]首领[.][ToggleRed] 才能[LF]\n执行此操作。[A][LF]\n这支部队的首领是艾瑞珂。[LF]\n让她移动到城门并 [.][ToggleRed]占领[.][ToggleRed] [.][LF]\n那里，即可完成本关。[.][A][X]\n"
    },
    {
      "english_payload_sha256": "01298b242b7381ab65902080ee4f5e8fd2a73b616a61c4ee765a727b72b2398c",
      "key": "game.chapter_event.msg_94a",
      "source_text_sha256": "74009585456ef55e5da3a4ccc2b7184f94b692e2b448fcfa443a8bb877b15dce",
      "subsystem": "chapter-event",
      "target_id": "0x094A",
      "text": "用[ToggleRed]十字键[.][ToggleRed]选择[LF]\n[ToggleRed]伤药[.][ToggleRed]，然后按 [.][LF]\nA键。[.][A][X]\n"
    },
    {
      "english_payload_sha256": "99cfa32b22eb0a740aca9a00a1710d47e15aae8453ec2b5e5f1402367dc9638c",
      "key": "game.chapter_event.msg_94d",
      "source_text_sha256": "6a98aba18c5a2fd7f269eb4ee5289320a3198b2587c90b1d1de45e5aac06d8e3",
      "subsystem": "chapter-event",
      "target_id": "0x094D",
      "text": "刚获得的[ToggleRed]伤药[.][ToggleRed][LF]\n可以立即使用。[A][LF]\n请从 [.][ToggleRed]物品[.][ToggleRed]中选择[.][LF]\n并使用 [.][ToggleRed]伤药[.][ToggleRed]。[A][X]\n"
    },
    {
      "english_payload_sha256": "1a3911448d88e6a40b417000153fe03ef31e9fde769a1838798992f03503f8c5",
      "key": "game.chapter_event.msg_950",
      "source_text_sha256": "3fdf8392c764e44c0030d97375489c3b67fbe64702ce76ad833944f45e3aa7c0",
      "subsystem": "chapter-event",
      "target_id": "0x0950",
      "text": "让塞思移动到敌人[.][LF]\n附近，然后按A键。[A][X]\n"
    },
    {
      "english_payload_sha256": "994c9120db3c0be67b520baa3f0058d42d770acfc823cce0529c49362d70e81a",
      "key": "game.chapter_event.msg_96b",
      "source_text_sha256": "4d99093f489530acaf464625fa17ea823d944ad53dded5b7a17328a1e43c872c",
      "subsystem": "chapter-event",
      "target_id": "0x096B",
      "text": "[OpenMidRight][LoadFace][FID_VillagerGirlBrownHair]\n[OpenMidLeft][LoadFace][FID_Active]\n[OpenMidRight]我被一个很帅的男人救了。[A][LF]\n虽然他的打扮像个佣兵，[LF]\n却有种高贵的气质[.][ToggleMouthMove]……[.][ToggleMouthMove][A][LF]\n他给了我这瓶特效药。[.][LF]\n一定会在战斗中派上用场。[.][A][X]\n"
    },
    {
      "english_payload_sha256": "1fec6a185b0c47341fbac109f1d516ea77a0dcd65ad16b79bd285b115e1cbfba",
      "key": "game.chapter_event.msg_96c",
      "source_text_sha256": "fb2a7573e54a2c9e4c62a8a2af140ce2be84d18f08f4b66b8652e4085dbfd61d",
      "subsystem": "chapter-event",
      "target_id": "0x096C",
      "text": "[OpenMidRight][LoadFace][FID_VillagerMan2]\n[OpenMidLeft][LoadFace][FID_Active]\n[OpenMidRight]嗯？怎么了？[LF]\n为什么这么慌张？[.][A][LF]\n什么？山、山贼！？[.][A][LF]\n不得了，快通知大家！[LF]\n关上村门！[A][LF]\n谢谢你来报信。[.][LF]\n请收下这份小小的谢礼。[A][X]\n"
    },
    {
      "english_payload_sha256": "e5ddac03afbdea675d3aceb5240f3f984c4863e9d6f7cd1789752a99a72a1cb1",
      "key": "game.chapter_event.msg_96e",
      "source_text_sha256": "ee48698296feb7cd4e9d515d2ea985ac52e3cea5b4aac6d40e47ada026c298b8",
      "subsystem": "chapter-event",
      "target_id": "0x096E",
      "text": "罗斯是[ToggleRed]年轻的战士[ToggleRed]。[.][A][LF]\n[ToggleRed]年轻的战士[ToggleRed]经验不足，[LF]\n战斗能力也很低。[A][LF]\n达到[ToggleRed]10级[ToggleRed]后，[A][LF]\n可以[ToggleRed]转职[ToggleRed]，成为更强的[.][LF]\n职业，如 [.][ToggleRed]战士[ToggleRed]或[ToggleRed]海盗[.][ToggleRed]。[.][A][LF]\n请避免让 [.][ToggleRed]年轻的战士[ToggleRed][LF]\n迎战强敌。[.][A][CR][LF]\n罗斯的父亲加西亚是 [.][ToggleRed]战士[.][ToggleRed]。[.][A][LF]\n[ToggleRed]战士[ToggleRed]达到10级以上后，[.][LF]\n可用[ToggleRed]英雄之证[.][ToggleRed]进行[ToggleRed]转职[ToggleRed]，[LF]\n成为 [.][ToggleRed]勇者[ToggleRed]或[ToggleRed]勇士[ToggleRed]。[.][A][CR][LF]\n此外，[ToggleRed]轻骑士[.][ToggleRed]和 [.][ToggleRed]重甲骑士[.][ToggleRed]也可 [.][LF]\n用[ToggleRed]骑士勋章[.][ToggleRed]进行[ToggleRed]转职[ToggleRed]。[.][LF]\n可以从[ToggleRed]两种[.][ToggleRed][LF]\n[ToggleRed]兵种[.][ToggleRed]中选择。[.][A][LF]\n请好好培养自己的单位，[LF]\n并在适当时机[ToggleRed]转职[ToggleRed]。[A][X]\n"
    },
    {
      "english_payload_sha256": "06942c0759243128f8c821dca8548e329e1f5456c180970aad05a49747e62ac5",
      "key": "game.chapter_event.msg_979",
      "source_text_sha256": "7acfbb20ec59c4a0fa725bb28aa63994462baf0343ecd0091035bee26c69c0a7",
      "subsystem": "chapter-event",
      "target_id": "0x0979",
      "text": "不要移动光标，[LF]\n再次按下A键。[.][A][X]\n"
    },
    {
      "english_payload_sha256": "74acd29fbc38edf294b9a06f0f9e6de89e100e20aef3c6d14118c24c8f555808",
      "key": "game.chapter_event.msg_983",
      "source_text_sha256": "424de784f654e520a8a50a8b83bc65009c4e8c83a58013316ec75975c1eeb4d3",
      "subsystem": "chapter-event",
      "target_id": "0x0983",
      "text": "现在选择 [.][ToggleRed]访问[.][ToggleRed]，[LF]\n再次按下A键。[.][A][X]\n"
    },
    {
      "english_payload_sha256": "fa7244fbf98f591d96aba780441c2526f24bd55795f102e5144f45f30d90aa03",
      "key": "game.chapter_event.msg_984",
      "source_text_sha256": "43ee88284d421b38a21593b5ce9e4237293640f4354fff2a7db3cda4ab57d5a4",
      "subsystem": "chapter-event",
      "target_id": "0x0984",
      "text": "试着和罗斯对话。请将光标[.][LF]\n对准 [.][ToggleRed]艾瑞珂[ToggleRed]并按下A键。[A][X]\n"
    },
    {
      "english_payload_sha256": "14931245e44686ba83e9bc4bcfe44feeac4eb666a108d184a562bbf0ac414a7d",
      "key": "game.chapter_event.msg_986",
      "source_text_sha256": "5809fafeb3fb7723347884d4e30fb8b9d66e4757873305d146ab95a99fa4d884",
      "subsystem": "chapter-event",
      "target_id": "0x0986",
      "text": "让艾瑞珂移动到罗斯身边。[.][LF]\n将光标移到闪烁的[LF]\n位置，然后按下A键。[.][A][X]\n"
    },
    {
      "english_payload_sha256": "6af1519681122ac6de648d009a35de200200980c4e651adf9b8c70a7c80757fe",
      "key": "game.chapter_event.msg_987",
      "source_text_sha256": "2b2f148612224c63233d98069c0e462b29d23f1027d8348f3f4ed1e7e444918d",
      "subsystem": "chapter-event",
      "target_id": "0x0987",
      "text": "选择 [.][ToggleRed]对话[ToggleRed]，[LF]\n然后按下A键。[.][A][X]\n"
    },
    {
      "english_payload_sha256": "96cd002858d5b12456fb90e52fa8d6df8abda004337ce451557898ec3df375ab",
      "key": "game.chapter_event.msg_aad",
      "source_text_sha256": "cf53a117cb2619a1837754890f6796621d02c1d35143ec610c9dabeb4c5b5920",
      "subsystem": "chapter-event",
      "target_id": "0x0AAD",
      "text": "[OpenMidLeft][LoadFace][FID_Ephraim]\n[OpenMidRight][LoadFace][FID_Soldier2]\n[OpenMidRight][ToggleMouthMove]……[ToggleMouthMove][A]\n[OpenMidLeft]我只问几个问题。若不想[.][LF]\n回答，就保持沉默。[A][LF]\n若想尽快结束这场战争，[.][LF]\n就请配合我。[A]\n[OpenMidRight][ToggleMouthMove]……[ToggleMouthMove][A][LF]\n[ToggleMouthMove]……[.][ToggleMouthMove]想知道什么？[.][A]\n[OpenMidLeft]古拉德为何侵略鲁内斯？[.][A]\n[OpenMidRight][ToggleMouthMove]……[.][ToggleMouthMove]我不知道。[A][LF]\n这场战争是奉[.][LF]\n皇帝陛下之命开始的。[.][A][LF]\n我们这些士兵根本[LF]\n不明白陛下的意图。[A]\n[OpenMidLeft]那么告诉我：[LF]\n杜塞尔将军现在何处？[.][A]\n[OpenMidRight]在帝都。将军从一开始[LF]\n就反对这场战争。[.][A][LF]\n他连日劝谏陛下，[.][LF]\n陛下却不予理会。[A][LF]\n听说有人开始质疑[.][LF]\n将军的忠诚。[A][LF]\n他如此直言，地位[.][ToggleMouthMove]——[ToggleMouthMove]甚至生命[ToggleMouthMove]——[ToggleMouthMove][LF]\n都已陷入危险。[A]\n[OpenMidLeft]是吗[ToggleMouthMove]……[.][ToggleMouthMove][A][LF]\n看来杜塞尔将军仍是[LF]\n我熟悉的那位忠直之人。[A][CloseSpeechSlow]\n[OpenMidLeft]那么利昂皇子呢？这一切[.][LF]\n发生时他在哪里？[A][LF]\n为何不设法制止[LF]\n他父亲的暴行？[.][A][BreakTalk]\n\n[OpenMidRight][ToggleMouthMove]……[ToggleMouthMove][A][CR][LF]\n据传闻[.][ToggleMouthMove]……[.][ToggleMouthMove][A][LF]\n劝彼加尔德皇帝发动[.][LF]\n战争的正是皇子本人。[A][BreakTalk]\n\n[OpenMidLeft]你说什么？[.][A][CR][LF]\n荒谬！[A][LF]\n我很了解利昂。没有人[.][LF]\n比他更厌恶战争。[.][A][LF]\n他绝不会做出[.][LF]\n引发这场血战的事！[.][A]\n[OpenMidRight][ClearFace]\n[OpenMidRight][LoadFace][FID_Seth]\n[OpenMidRight]伊弗列姆王子，请冷静。[.][A]\n[OpenMidLeft][ToggleMouthMove]……[.][ToggleMouthMove]抱歉。[A][X]\n"
    },
    {
      "english_payload_sha256": "6578ce58b87980cc82306836f7e75d65af2a70d82ff696b02f48a48e90faad06",
      "key": "game.chapter_event.msg_b2a",
      "source_text_sha256": "542c6b90fd33d2d7bbb1ca216a9137a01ff4e7e7db16b255cf2a2a54f2e723b9",
      "subsystem": "chapter-event",
      "target_id": "0x0B2A",
      "text": "[OpenLeft]听说利昂是在得到[LF]\n【魔石】后变了。[.][A][LF]\n我不懂魔法，可是[ToggleMouthMove]……[.][ToggleMouthMove][LF]\n当时的他实在很不寻常。[A][LF]\n仿佛他自己也正被[LF]\n某种东西操纵着。[A]\n[OpenFarLeft][ToggleMouthMove]……[ToggleMouthMove][A]\n[OpenRight]你们二位也许很难[.][LF]\n接受，但是[ToggleMouthMove]……[.][ToggleMouthMove][A][LF]\n利昂皇子的本意已不重要。[LF]\n他持有【魔石】。[A][LF]\n那块石头正是一切的[LF]\n元凶。必须阻止皇子。[.][A][BreakTalk]\n\n[OpenFarRight]不，还不行。首先有件[.][LF]\n事情必须完成。[.][A]\n[OpenFarLeft]拉切尔？[A]\n[OpenFarRight]伊弗列姆王子，您应该[LF]\n也感觉到了吧。[A][LF]\n利昂皇子持有的【魔石】[ToggleMouthMove]……[.][ToggleMouthMove][LF]\n散发着骇人的邪气[ToggleMouthMove]……[.][ToggleMouthMove][A][LF]\n若只是利昂皇子还好，[LF]\n但那石头绝非凡人可敌。[A]\n[OpenFarLeft]那么……该怎么办？[.][A]\n[OpenFarRight]【圣石】。[A]\n[OpenFarLeft]【圣石】？[A]\n[OpenFarRight]大家都听说过[.][LF]\n五颗【圣石】的传说。[.][A][LF]\n只有它们拥有[.][LF]\n永远封印魔王的力量。[.][A][LF]\n所以，要驱散邪恶的魔力，[LF]\n当然必须使用【圣石】！[.][A]\n[OpenRight]要把这场战争的结果[LF]\n寄托在愚蠢的传说上？[A]\n[OpenLeft][ToggleMouthMove]……[.][ToggleMouthMove]不只是传说。[LF]\n我们还有希望。[A][CloseSpeechSlow]\n[OpenLeft]据利昂所说，[A][LF]\n他已毁掉古拉德、弗雷利亚和[.][LF]\n贾哈那的【圣石】。[A]\n[OpenFarLeft]嗯，那就说得通了[.][ToggleMouthMove]……[.][ToggleMouthMove][A][LF]\n古拉德军曾袭击我，企图[.][LF]\n破坏鲁内斯的【圣石】。[.][A][LF]\n若这正是他们[LF]\n入侵鲁内斯的原因[ToggleMouthMove]……[.][ToggleMouthMove][A][LF]\n【圣石】的力量或许[LF]\n远比我们所知的强大。[A]\n[OpenFarRight]没错，正是如此！[.][A][LF]\n只要得到一颗【圣石】，我们就能[LF]\n对抗【魔石】的力量！[A]\n[OpenRight]但已有三颗【圣石】[.][LF]\n被毁，我们选择不多。[.][A][LF]\n你是说在[.][LF]\n鲁内斯被侵略时[ToggleMouthMove]……[.][ToggleMouthMove][A]\n[OpenLeft]不，我想未必。[.][A][LF]\n鲁内斯的【圣石】由[LF]\n我和艾瑞珂的腕轮封印着。[.][A]\n[OpenFarLeft]古拉德多次试图[LF]\n夺走我们的腕轮。[A][LF]\n每一次都失败了，所以[LF]\n圣石或许仍然安全。[A]\n[OpenLeft]当然，我们必须确认。[.][A][LF]\n古拉德已被击败，我们也该[.][LF]\n把目光转向祖国了。[A][LF]\n是时候返回鲁内斯了。[A][X]\n"
    },
